%% flow-v3 增量时序图：keep1 单向匹配池（只服务失主侧）+ 低分 60 视觉口径
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Finder as 拾得者（keep1 发布者）
    actor Owner as 失主
    participant FE as MatchesView.vue
    participant API as MatchRouter (FastAPI)
    participant PS as PublishService
    participant MS as MatchService
    participant DB as SQLite/MySQL

    rect rgb(240, 247, 255)
    Note over Finder,DB: 流程 1 —— keep1 拾物发布：反向不放开（拾得者不获得任何候选）
    Finder->>API: POST /found-items (keep_status=1)
    API->>PS: publish_found(finder, dto)
    PS->>DB: INSERT found_item(keep_status=1, status=PENDING)
    Note right of PS: keep_status=1 不加信誉分（仅 keep0 +1，不变）
    PS->>PS: _reverse_match_found(found)
    Note right of PS: 保留早退：keep_status==NOT_KEEPING → return []
    PS-->>API: (found, matches=[])
    API-->>Finder: 200 { item, suspected_matches: [] }
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 244)
    Note over Owner,DB: 流程 2 —— 失主发布失物：正向放开，keep1 进匹配池
    Owner->>API: POST /lost-items
    API->>PS: publish_lost(publisher, dto)
    PS->>DB: INSERT lost_item(status=PENDING_MATCH)
    PS->>PS: _reverse_match_lost(lost)
    PS->>DB: SELECT found_item WHERE status=PENDING AND deleted_at IS NULL
    Note right of DB: 本次删除 keep_status==KEEPING 过滤<br/>keep0 与 keep1 同池召回
    DB-->>PS: candidates(keep0 + keep1)
    loop 每个候选（已过 _exists_match 去重）
        PS->>MS: score(lost, found)
        MS-->>PS: 五维加权分（15/20/50/10/5）
    end
    PS->>PS: sort(-score, found_id)[:MATCH_TOP_N=10]
    PS->>DB: INSERT match_record(status=0 PENDING_CLAIM) × N
    PS->>DB: UPDATE lost.status = MATCHING
    PS-->>API: (lost, created)
    API-->>Owner: 200 { item, suspected_matches }
    end

    rect rgb(255, 251, 240)
    Note over Owner,DB: 流程 3 —— 失主侧「我的匹配」渲染（低分 60 视觉口径）
    Owner->>FE: 打开 /matches
    FE->>API: GET /matches?page_size=200
    API->>DB: as_lost ∪ as_found，去重 + _counterpart_hidden 过滤
    DB-->>API: MatchOut[]（含 found_item.keep_status / match_score / suspected）
    API-->>FE: 200 Page<MatchOut>
    FE->>FE: isLowScore(m) = match_score < MATCH_LOW_SCORE(60)
    Note right of FE: <60 → 弱化标签 +『match-card--low』虚线卡片<br/>60~79 → 常规展示（本次变更点）<br/>>=80 → suspected 徽标（后端语义不变）
    FE->>FE: applyButtonText = keep_status===1 ? '我要领走' : '申请匹配'
    end

    rect rgb(248, 240, 255)
    Note over Owner,DB: 流程 4 —— 失主点「我要领走」：一步完成（无交接码、无拾得者确认）
    Owner->>FE: 点击「我要领走」
    FE->>Owner: ElMessageBox 二次确认（keep1 分支优先，早退，不叠加低分弹窗）
    Owner-->>FE: 确认
    FE->>API: POST /matches/{id}/claim-complete
    API->>API: 校验 lost.publisher_id == user.id（否则 403）
    API->>PS: complete_keep1_claim(match)
    PS->>PS: 校验 found.keep_status==1 / match.status==0 / found.status==0
    PS->>DB: match.status=2, flow_type=1, completed_at=now
    PS->>DB: lost.status=RESOLVED(3), found.status=RESOLVED(1), expires_at +90d
    PS->>DB: INSERT audit(keep1_claim_complete)
    API-->>FE: 200 MatchOut(status=2, flow_type=1)
    FE->>FE: 已完成 tab 显示「交接已完成」+「撤回」按钮（canRevoke）
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
    Note over Finder,DB: 流程 5 —— keep1 单向性守卫（关键：候选对拾得者仍可见，必须挡住写操作）
    Finder->>FE: 打开 /matches（as_found 分支命中同一条候选）
    FE->>FE: isKeep1Candidate(m) → 渲染只读「留在原地·等待失主自取」，不渲染确认归还/拒绝
    Note over Finder,API: 防御纵深：即使绕过前端直调接口
    Finder->>API: POST /matches/{id}/confirm-return
    API->>API: found.keep_status==1 → ParamError 422
    API-->>Finder: 422「该物品留在原地未挪动，无需你确认归还」
    Finder->>API: POST /matches/{id}/reject
    API->>API: found.keep_status==1 → ParamError 422
    API-->>Finder: 422「该物品留在原地未挪动，是否被领走由失主决定」
    Note over API: handover/generate 要求 status==CLAIMING(1)，<br/>keep1 候选被 claim 的 422 挡在 status=0，路径不可达 → 无需守卫
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over Owner,DB: 流程 6 —— 撤回与老数据自助回填
    Owner->>API: POST /matches/{id}/revoke
    API->>PS: revoke_keep1_claim(match)
    PS->>DB: match.status=6, lost/found 状态回退, audit(keep1_claim_revoke)
    Note right of PS: _exists_match 排除 {2,3,6} → 同 (lost,found) 可再次生成候选/再次申请
    Owner->>FE: 点击「刷新候选」
    FE->>API: POST /lost-items/{id}/refresh-matches
    API->>PS: refresh_lost_candidates(lost)
    PS->>PS: 复用 _recall_lost_candidates（已放开）
    Note right of PS: 存量 keep1 拾物（status=PENDING 且未软删）由此自助补入<br/>→ 变更 C 不写回填脚本的成本为 0
    PS-->>API: created ≤ MATCH_TOP_N - existing
    API-->>Owner: 200 { created, matches }
    end
